[Info]
Name	Long Winter
Description	A long duel with room to expand before anyone meets. Half turn symmetric. 2 players. A hero company holds twin keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

